BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:antiparos-antiparos-chora-klidonas-bonfires-of-agios-ioannis-antiparos-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270623
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270625
SUMMARY:Klidonas bonfires of Agios Ioannis\, Antiparos harbour
LOCATION:Antiparos (Chora)\, Antiparos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:On the evening of 23 June the May wreaths from the doorways are collected and burned on the waterfront\, children jump the fires and the local dance group performs the Klidonas custom\, with kerasmata and music afterwards. Small and genuinely local\; it is over by midnight.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/antiparos/#antiparos-chora-klidonas-bonfires-of-agios-ioannis-antiparos
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/antiparos/#antiparos-chora-klidonas-bonfires-of-agios-ioannis-antiparos
END:VEVENT
